# This project is a static HTML/CSS/JS site with no build step and no
# server-side code, so it does not read .env files at runtime.
#
# The one integration point is the booking form's submission endpoint,
# which is configured directly in script.js (not via environment
# variables) so it can be set at build/deploy time by static hosting.
# See CONFIG.bookingEndpoint near the top of script.js.
#
# BOOKING_ENDPOINT is documented here as a placeholder for whatever
# form backend you connect (e.g. Formspree, a serverless function, your
# own API). Replace the placeholder value only — never commit real
# credentials to this file or to script.js.
BOOKING_ENDPOINT=https://example.com/replace-with-your-form-endpoint
